<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Urmila | My Beautiful World</title>
<meta name="description" content="Welcome to Urmila's personal website, a beautiful space for photos, memories and stories.">
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;background:#fff8f6;color:#392c31}
header{padding:18px;text-align:center;background:#f3dfe3}
header h2{margin:0;color:#a44e68;letter-spacing:3px}
nav{text-align:center;padding:14px;background:white}
nav a{margin:0 8px;color:#93465d;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:65px 20px 55px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f9e8e9,#fff8f3)}
.hero .circle{width:135px;height:135px;border-radius:50%;margin:auto;background:#e8bfc9;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:65px;color:#91445c}
h1{font-size:48px;font-weight:normal;margin:20px 0 10px}
h1 span{color:#b65d78;font-style:italic}
p{line-height:1.8;color:#75636a}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#a44e68;color:white;border:0;border-radius:30px;padding:13px 24px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;margin-top:12px}
section{padding:48px 20px;text-align:center}
h2{font-weight:normal;font-size:30px}
.about{background:white}
.card{max-width:650px;margin:20px auto;padding:25px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #efdce0;border-radius:18px}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;max-width:700px;margin:25px auto}
.photo{height:160px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e9c8d0,#f8e9df);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:38px}
.memories{background:#f8e9e9}
.musicbox{max-width:500px;margin:20px auto;padding:20px;background:white;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid #efdce0}
footer{padding:25px;text-align:center;background:#f3dfe3;color:#754b58}
@media(max-width:480px){h1{font-size:39px}.gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.photo{height:130px}nav a{margin:0 5px;font-size:12px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><h2>♡ URMILA ♡</h2></header>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
<a href="#memories">Memories</a>
</nav>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<div class="circle">U</div>
<h1>Hello, I'm <span>Urmila</span></h1>
<p>A little world of beautiful moments, dreams and memories.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#about">Discover My World ♡</a>
</section>
<section class="about" id="about">
<h2>About Me</h2>
<div class="card">
<p>Welcome to my personal website! This is my little corner of the internet, where I can share my favourite photos, special memories and the little things that make life beautiful.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="gallery">
<h2>My Photo Gallery</h2>
<p>Beautiful moments deserve a special place.</p>
<div class="gallery">
<div class="photo">♡</div>
<div class="photo">✿</div>
<div class="photo">✧</div>
</div>
<p>Sample placeholders — add your own photos later.</p>
</section>
<section class="memories" id="memories">
<h2>Beautiful Memories</h2>
<div class="card"><h3>Little Things, Big Memories</h3>
<p>Every new day brings a new story. Keep the memories that make you smile and the dreams that inspire you.</p></div>
<div class="musicbox">
<h3>Soft Instrumental Music ♫</h3>
<p>Music starts only when you press play.</p>
<audio id="music" loop src="music.mp3"></audio>
<button class="btn" onclick="toggleMusic()" id="play">▶ Play Music</button>
<p id="status">Add a licensed music.mp3 file to enable music.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="contact">
<h2>Stay Connected</h2>
<p>More special moments coming soon.</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer>Made with ♡ for Urmila</footer>
<script>
async function toggleMusic(){
const m=document.getElementById('music');
const b=document.getElementById('play');
const s=document.getElementById('status');
if(m.paused){
try{await m.play();b.textContent='❚❚ Pause Music';s.textContent='Music is playing ♫'}
catch(e){s.textContent='Upload a licensed music.mp3 file beside index.html first'}
}else{m.pause();b.textContent='▶ Play Music';s.textContent='Music paused'}
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
